	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08pc0101_boy2_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガさんが　ポケモンと　たびをするなら
ポケモンが　うけた　いたみを▽
じぶんの　いたみとして　かんじろ　だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T06:35:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:13:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガさんが　ポケモンと　旅をするなら
ポケモンが　受けた　痛みを▽
自分の　痛みとして　感じろ　だって！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-11T06:41:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:13:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:12:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-10T09:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
